Contacts7
==========

Stage 7 of the address book made in the book "Writing Desktop
Applications in JavaScript" (Manuals.JSApps), chapter 7. This stage
keeps address books in files of their own (type &1C4): click
SELECT on the icon bar icon for a new book, save with F3,
double-click a Contacts file to open it. Several books can be open.

The finished address book is !Contacts.
